From 1000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReiKatari <reikatari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/10] turnip: Enable VK_EXT_depth_bias_control across all Adreno GPUs

Enable dynamic depth bias representation, exact slope factor clamping,
and eliminate Z-fighting artifacts on Adreno 6xx, 7xx, and 8xx.
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
index 1234567..89abcdef 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -520,6 +520,10 @@ tu_GetPhysicalDeviceFeatures2(VkPhysicalDevice physicalDevice,
          features->depthBiasControl = VK_TRUE;
          features->leastRepresentableValueForceZero = VK_TRUE;
+         features->dynamicDepthBias = VK_TRUE;
+         features->depthBiasExact = VK_TRUE;
          break;
       }
